OL,3,GNEWSAStudent union warns against
OL,4,Aself-swab 'rape kit' use
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student union has warned against the
OL,7,Fuse of self-swab "rape kits" after they
OL,8,Fwere "promoted" to university starters.
OL,10,FNottingham Trent Students' Union (NTSU)
OL,11,Fsaid it was "concerned" the kits -
OL,12,Fdesigned for sexual assault victims to
OL,13,Fgather their own evidence - were being
OL,14,F"promoted" to students.
OL,16,FThe kits have come under the scrutiny
OL,17,Fof legal and forensic experts, who say
OL,18,Fthe samples could give false assurance
OL,19,Fto victims as they may not be usable as
OL,20,Fevidence in court.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
