OL,3,GNEWSAStudent union warns against
OL,4,Aself-swab 'rape kit' use
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnough, a company issuing the kits -
OL,7,Fwhich had its online posts banned last
OL,8,Fyear - claimed the kits could "in
OL,9,Fprinciple" be used as evidence. The
OL,10,Fswabs have not been successfully used
OL,11,Fas evidence in court, according to
OL,12,FEnough.
